&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 111.46666666666666666666666667px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;投資委員会&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;（任意の委員会）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 173.6px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・M&amp;amp;Aやアライアンス等の成長投資を促進するために、中長期的な視野に立った事業戦略に基づく投資方針や個々の投資案件に関する審議を行う&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 100.8px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;佐藤清之輔&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;（取締役）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 216.46666666666666666666666667px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;［社内取締役］&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;関口朋宏、高橋隆史&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;［社外取締役］&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;佐野哲哉、石井隆一&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;［執行役員］&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;西村順（COO）、&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;狗巻勝博（戦略投資担当）、&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;猪鼻聡（CAO）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class="style_pb_after" style="text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1.3333333333333333333333333333px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
